{% comment %}
@description: Khung bao ngoai moi trang — <head> (title/meta/JSON-LD SEO), goi header/footer, cho block content chen vao giua.
@required_substrings: {% block content %}{% endblock %}, /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/tailwind.js, pageTitle, {% render "header", {% render "footer", {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", {% render "components/common/cart-drawer", /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css, /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.js
@required_ids:
@notes: PHAI giu <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title> - MOI route (blog.ts/pages.ts/products.ts...) deu tinh rieng pageTitle/metaDescription/noindex/schemas cho tung trang, truoc day layout.liquid bo qua het 4 bien nay (title hardcode = site.siteName cho MOI TRANG, khong co meta description/noindex/JSON-LD gi ca - da sua). PHAI giu <meta name="description"> khi co metaDescription, <meta name="robots" content="noindex"> khi noindex truthy, va vong lap {% for schema in schemas %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ schema | json }}</script>{% endfor %} (schemas la array object thuong, filter "json" co san trong LiquidJS mac dinh, KHONG can tu dang ky). PHAI dung <script src="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/tailwind.js"> (KHONG duoc doi lai thanh <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com">) - ban vendor tinh cua Tailwind CDN da tai san ve themes/{slug}/assets/tailwind.js, serve qua route rieng trong themeAssets.ts. Ly do: dung domain ngoai bat buoc phai whitelist rieng trong CSP script-src (security.ts), quen whitelist se lam CSP chan sach script, mat toan bo style + "tailwind is not defined" (loi that da gap nhieu lan) - tu host loai bo hoan toan phu thuoc domain ngoai nay. PHAI giu {% block content %}{% endblock %} de noi dung tung trang chen vao, PHAI goi {% render "header", site: site, headerMenu: headerMenu %} va {% render "footer", site: site, footerMenu: footerMenu, year: year %}, PHAI giu {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", ... %} o trong layout de breadcrumb hien toan site khi route truyen breadcrumbs, PHAI goi {% render "components/common/cart-drawer" %} ngay truoc the dong body, PHAI giu the <link> toi /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css va <script> toi .../custom.js (CSS/JS tuy bien rieng cua theme, sinh/sua o buoc khac). Duoc tu do doi font (Google Fonts link), tailwind.config (mau sac, fontFamily), bo cuc <body> ngoai cac phan bat buoc tren.
{% endcomment %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title>
    {% if site.faviconUrl %}<link rel="icon" href="{{ site.faviconUrl }}">{% endif %}
    {% if metaDescription %}<meta name="description" content="{{ metaDescription | escape }}">{% endif %}
    {% if noindex %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex">{% endif %}
    {% for schema in schemas %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ schema | json }}</script>{% endfor %}
    {% comment %} Load DUY NHAT 1 lan o day cho toan trang - checkout.liquid + components/customer-
    chat.liquid CUNG co the co widget ".cf-turnstile" tren CUNG 1 trang (chat hien moi trang qua
    layout.liquid). 1 script api.js tu quet/render MOI div ".cf-turnstile" no thay (implicit
    rendering) - khong can nap them lan nao nua, nap 2 lan gay loi that console "Turnstile has
    already been loaded" va co the lam 1 trong 2 widget khong hoat dong. {% endcomment %}
    {% if site.turnstileSiteKey %}<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>{% endif %}

    <!-- Fonts: Poppins (mang chatbot-lite sang) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preload" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" as="style" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
    <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"></noscript>

    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/tailwind.js"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            dark: '#1b5e20',
                            DEFAULT: '#43a047',
                            hover: '#2e7d32',
                            light: '#e8f5e9',
                            gray: '#64748B'
                        },
                        blue: {
                            50: '#e8f5e9',
                            100: '#c8e6c9',
                            200: '#a5d6a7',
                            300: '#81c784',
                            400: '#66bb6a',
                            500: '#4caf50',
                            600: '#43a047',
                            700: '#388e3c',
                            800: '#2e7d32',
                            900: '#1b5e20'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Poppins', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'glass': '0 8px 32px 0 rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08)',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <!-- Custom CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css">
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-slate-900 bg-white min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-brand selection:text-white">

    {% render "header", site: site, headerMenu: headerMenu %}

    {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", breadcrumbs: breadcrumbs, breadcrumbVariant: "default" %}

    <main class="flex-grow">
        {% block content %}{% endblock %}
    </main>

    {% render "components/common/cart-drawer" %}

    {% render "footer", site: site, footerMenu: footerMenu, year: year %}

    <!-- Live Chat -->
    {% if site.cskhAgentId %}
      {% render "components/customer-chat", site: site, chatSessionId: chatSessionId, chatHmacToken: chatHmacToken %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Custom JS -->
    <script src="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
